{"version":1,"key":"card:90","content":{"id":90,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5871c100-cfe2-4e36-bcb2-d9effdb867eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cd"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示 change directory，它的作用是用来切换工作目录的，它的基本使用如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"2a5e156c-2a16-4c95-8149-bfaf6368205b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8ce7fad2-a2bf-45c8-812a-20725066a66e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"cd dir","collabId":"25fc556d-e83b-4b88-9d84-3f6dca975242","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8519eabe-5380-4bb3-a872-8e4006997a56","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dir"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个路径，它可以是相对路径，也可以是绝对路径"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"37efae59-1292-41d9-bf43-7f3174bfde71","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8c6cfeb9-d91f-4940-859f-782465da6649","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 切换到 /tmp 目录\n~ » cd /tmp\n/tmp » ls\nmath  tmpscfytyzt  tmux-1000\n# 切换到工作目录下的 math 目录\n/tmp » cd math\n/tmp/math » ls\nadd  add.c","collabId":"ef167994-c5d0-46c1-8958-37de5a43c1ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"68e4745b-2b14-4eaf-b593-aca773486a65","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 Linux 中有几个特别的目录，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"~"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示用户的家目录，因此通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cd ~"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以切换到家目录，或者直接使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cd"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令，不指定任何的路径也可以直接切换到家目录。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"8397b2d6-7da1-4c95-87db-16459d9f81f6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b92ee130-ee09-4f55-aa61-7ac2707b39f8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 切换到家目录\ncd ~\n# 不指定任何路径，也表示切换到家目录\ncd","collabId":"d9683da8-3f43-4a26-aa78-6cb2a1f84859","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dc154c8c-3b86-4c99-bff8-5a92efeabef5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有两个特殊的目录，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"."},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示当前目录，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":".."},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示上一级目录，在每个目录中都有这两个特殊目录，这两个目录都是隐藏目录，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ls -a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令查看隐藏文件"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"29d7887a-3ca3-4845-a2b2-957e36f929d3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1270167c-be23-4883-9420-ed29a9bee2d9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » ls -a\n.              .cache      .local           .sudo_as_admin_successful       hello\n..             .conda      .motd_shown      .viminfo                        hello.c\n.Xauthority    .condarc    .oh-my-zsh       .zcompdump                      math\n.bash_history  .config     .profile         .zcompdump-DESKTOP-PUSQM6M-5.8\n.bash_logout   .landscape  .python_history  .zsh_history\n.bashrc        .lesshst    .ssh             .zshrc","collabId":"4a300317-d07b-4016-a1e3-cf278f910fc